Just a quick update for everyone, https://patchwork.kernel.org is back
online, and all but the linux-pm mailing lists are receiving and
processing data.

All the old user account still exist, though it is *HIGHLY* recommended
that once you log in you change your password.

If a list would like us to feed in the intervening mail for their
mailing list, that's doable - please contact ftpadmin@kernel.org and we
can work out the logistics.

If anyone has a mailing list that needs to get added, please (re)send
the request to ftpadmin@kernel.org, and we'll get it set up.

As always, if you see anything amiss, please let us know so we can get
it fixed as quickly as possible.

- - John 'Warthog9' Hawley
